Okay: I'm stuck.

Here's some sample data:

n <- 24

alist <- c("alpha", "bravo", "charlie",
"delta","echo","foxtrot","golf","hotel","india","juliett","kilo","lima","mike","november","oscar","papa","quebec","romeo","sierra","tango","uniform","victor","whiskey","xray")

