Subject: Minor Improvements to Figure
Message-ID: <oXSbrhuzVmk.1qpEMllIYN4J@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/oXSbrhuzVmk/m/1qpEMllIYN4J>
